Hi! Yeah, that's the answer. Eg if you have lots of sister species with A,AB , that will favor DEC models over DIVALIKE models, whereas lots of AB,CD sisters will favor DIVALIKE models.  If +J is the most important thing then DEC+J and DIVALIKE+J will be similar although one or the other might be a bit better. Cheers! Nick

